do CelyneLoop.play_bgm()
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/PART OF YOUR WORLD.png" fade="0.0"]
join Celyna center
join Seyche left [animation="Fade In" length="0.0"]
Celyna (Sad): Dear?[pause=0.4] What’s wrong..
Seyche: Oh! [pause=0.4]Nothing, it’s just.. [pause=0.4]Something that I heard today.
Celyna: You know you can tell me anything...
Seyche (Uncomfortable): Well, something Ermir told me has been on my mind for a bit.
Seyche: It’s about.. [pause=0.8]Styrmir,[pause=0.4] and well,[pause=0.4] me.
Celyna: .....
[wait time="3.0"]
Celyna: Styrmir.. He did something in the past.. To you.
Seyche: ..How?[pause=0.8] I wasn’t even here until a few months ago.. [pause=0.4]And I never met this Styrmir guy.
Celyna: Seyche, This isn’t your first time here.[pause=0.4] You’ve been here before.
Seyche (Surprised): I-I have?[pause=0.4] How have I not remembered anything?
Celyna: Back then, Styrmir disliked your worshippers and he had warned you about it.
Celyna: You’ve told me about it.
Celyna: Then you didn’t listen... [pause=0.4]And the rest... [pause=0.4]Well, Styrmir never went back on his word.
Seyche (Normal): ... Oh...